# Cross-origin isolation: gives the page SharedArrayBuffer, so bb.js runs
# its multithreaded WASM for the tier-2 UltraHonk verification (measured
# live on the shop: ~13 s single-threaded vs ~2 s with threads). Safe here —
# the rentals UI is self-contained (QR codes are data: URLs) and its API
# calls are same-origin. Applies to static assets only; the Worker's
# /oid4vp/* and /api/* responses are unaffected.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
